#X text 6 6 To create the score file \, first you must create a new .txt file. Inside it \, in the first line you define the BPM of the score \, for example \, BPM 120, f 102;
#X text 7 56 Once you do this \, you must define the events of the score. For example \, a C4 events with a quarter will be defined as NOTE C4 1 in a measure 4/4. Because this note lasts for 1 beat., f 102;
